  "description": "Polaris processors: per-processor consumed/emitted/failed/retry/DLQ rates and observed lag. Panels reference `polaris_processor_*` metrics defined in libs/pipeline/src/metrics.ts. The $processor_name variable picks one of the live processors (sync-identity-resolver, sync-enrichment-runtime, sessionizer, attribution-engine, merge-worker).",
